description:
Make a statement in this breezy blue &amp; white tie-dye sleeveless dress, crafted in 100% soft rayon for all-day comfort. Designed with a relaxed fit, subtle flare, and functional side pocket, this dress blends style and ease perfectly. Ideal for sunny days, casual outings, or brunch dates—pair it with white sneakers or flats for a laid-back yet polished look.
Sleeves:Sleeve less
Fabric: Soft 100% Rayon fabric.
Pattern:Tie &amp; Dye
Care Info: Hand wash separately in cold water, use mild detergent. Do not bleach, dry in shade, do not wring or tumble dry.
✨ Want to see how to style this dress for brunches, vacations, or evening outings?  👉 [Read our full styling guide on Medium]
 
